      "writtenOn": "2025-04-17T12:58:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we have numbers of how the perf improves? We skip one copy potentially but I\u0027d assume SSA form in LLVM IR would optimize it out. Another important optimization is that if N \u003c 32/64 then the iterator could contain just a uint32_t / uin64_t which removes a bunch of branches and logic from the iterator.",
