      "writtenOn": "2025-04-17T16:58:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At this point I\u0027m not seeing this change make much of a difference in performance, but my primary goal was simplification, not optimization. I found from my previous attempt with https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/232257 that the structure that we had with ityp::bitset and BitSetIterator separately was complicating attempts to port Dawn to a more optimal bitset implementation (regardless of what we\u0027re focusing our optimization efforts on.)",
